WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.920
Follow a denied action
through the gateway.

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:06.480
The request carries an action,
resource and run identifier.

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.680
The gateway checks policy
and approval before execution.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:14.320
A denial is recorded with its policy
version, and the runtime stops

00:00:14.453 --> 00:00:18.520
or escalates. The scoped
tool is never invoked.

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:22.960
Verify the absence of the prohibited side
effect and the correlated event record.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.360
A reassuring assistant message
alone does not prove enforcement.
